The one question you'll ask within an hour of landing in Japan 🚻
Learn it now, thank yourself at the airport.

Today's phrases:
• トイレは どこですか (toire wa doko desu ka) = Where is the toilet?
• まっすぐ (massugu) = Straight
• みぎ (migi) = Right

